WEBVTT

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:42.330
<i>Chou Soran chose to participate 
in the Raten Taishou,</i>

00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:45.410
<i>a tournament to determine 
the Tenshi's successor.</i>

00:01:45.410 --> 00:01:48.410
<i>He trained intensely with Fuu Houhou.</i>

00:01:48.410 --> 00:01:50.690
Ow...

00:01:51.230 --> 00:01:52.910
Hey, Hou-nee!

00:01:52.910 --> 00:01:55.040
Go easy on me!

00:01:55.040 --> 00:01:58.290
Is this really your best?

00:01:59.150 --> 00:02:02.800
<i>The current Tenshi seeks to 
make Soran his successor.</i>

00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:05.760
<i>Meanwhile, the Ten Elders plot to stop him.</i>

00:02:06.290 --> 00:02:08.820
<i>Rikukin, friend of the Tenshi,</i>

00:02:08.820 --> 00:02:14.360
<i>announced his intention to give his secret 
Tsuutenroku technique to the winner.</i>

00:02:14.980 --> 00:02:17.870
<i>Trouble was brewing in the background.</i>

00:02:18.530 --> 00:02:22.940
<i>Meanwhile, Jo San and Jo Yon of the 
Express Delivery Company noticed</i>

00:02:22.940 --> 00:02:27.820
<i>the suspicious movements of Zensei, an 
organization after Chou Soran's kitaigen style.</i>

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:32.080
<i>They secretly brainwashed 
Koketsu of Tougousou</i>

00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:35.230
<i>and planned to send him to the Raten Taishou.</i>

00:02:36.990 --> 00:02:41.280
<i>His training complete, Soran arrived 
at Ryuukosan, the tournament site,</i>

00:02:41.280 --> 00:02:43.340
<i>where he met Ouya of Butousan,</i>

00:02:43.920 --> 00:02:46.420
<i>descendant of Shokatsu Koumei, Shokatsu Sei,</i>

00:02:46.420 --> 00:02:49.910
<i>and other outsiders from all over the world.</i>

00:02:56.570 --> 00:03:00.360
The selection tournament will now begin.

00:03:02.810 --> 00:03:08.560
<i>Tournament favorite Chou Reigyoku defeated 
his opponents with overwhelming strength.</i>

00:03:09.590 --> 00:03:12.290
<i>Houhou easily made it 
through her first battle.</i>

00:03:12.820 --> 00:03:17.540
<i>And now, Soran's battle is about to begin...</i>

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:19.000
He's here.

00:03:23.150 --> 00:03:26.330
Thirty years east of the river,

00:03:27.070 --> 00:03:30.180
thirty years west of the river.

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:33.510
Life has its ups and downs.

00:03:35.070 --> 00:03:38.960
Now is the time to avenge my grandfather.

00:03:40.470 --> 00:03:46.120
I am the successor to the secret 
arts of the kitaigen style:

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:48.370
Chou Soran!

00:03:57.130 --> 00:04:02.380
<b>3: Shameless</b>

00:04:10.330 --> 00:04:13.980
I-I wouldn't expect less from the 
successor to the kitaigen style.

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:16.060
His presence is overwhelming.

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:18.040
Avenge his grandfather?

00:04:18.040 --> 00:04:19.220
What is he talking about?

00:04:19.530 --> 00:04:22.190
And what's with these clouds?

00:04:33.260 --> 00:04:37.460
Chou Soran, all the outsiders are 
talking about your kitaigen style.

00:04:37.460 --> 00:04:40.060
Now show us what your power can do.

00:04:40.060 --> 00:04:41.940
You can't blame us for 
fighting three-on-one.

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:46.560
Three against one?

00:04:50.810 --> 00:04:52.260
What's so funny?

00:04:52.850 --> 00:04:57.560
Three amateurs like yourselves 
challenging my kitaigen style?

00:04:57.560 --> 00:04:58.600
What a joke.

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:02.590
Insects who choose to team up against me

00:05:02.590 --> 00:05:05.360
aren't worthy to challenge the kitaigen style.

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:07.090
Insects?

00:05:07.090 --> 00:05:11.250
Yes. The only worthy opponents 
for me are the Ten Elders.

00:05:11.580 --> 00:05:13.860
The greatest warriors of the world.

00:05:14.840 --> 00:05:15.850
Yes!

00:05:15.850 --> 00:05:21.630
I will defeat each and every 
powerful warrior under this sky!

00:05:23.590 --> 00:05:25.870
He's so confident.

00:05:25.870 --> 00:05:28.140
He even challenged the Ten Elders.

00:05:28.510 --> 00:05:31.630
In any case, the three of us 
should be able to beat him.

00:05:31.630 --> 00:05:33.530
Let's get this over with quickly.

00:05:33.530 --> 00:05:34.210
Wait.

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:36.120
He's right.

00:05:36.120 --> 00:05:39.480
We should fight him fair and square.

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:40.380
What?

00:05:40.910 --> 00:05:42.410
Thank you, Chou Soran.

00:05:42.830 --> 00:05:44.750
Your words have opened my eyes.

00:05:45.220 --> 00:05:48.400
I didn't come here to win.

00:05:48.400 --> 00:05:50.450
I came to test my strength.

00:05:50.840 --> 00:05:53.260
I wish to fight you fair and square.

00:05:54.790 --> 00:05:57.500
So you'll challenge me alone?

00:05:57.850 --> 00:05:59.850
S-So what?

00:06:02.650 --> 00:06:05.000
You think you're strong 
enough to challenge me?

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:05.950
Don't make me laugh.

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:09.050
What do you think you're doing?

00:06:09.860 --> 00:06:12.250
Don't underestimate the kitaigen style.

00:06:12.250 --> 00:06:16.480
If you wish to challenge me,
you must prove your worthiness.

00:06:16.910 --> 00:06:19.640
Prove your strength to me!

00:06:21.940 --> 00:06:26.300
Who among you is most worthy of facing me?

00:06:26.580 --> 00:06:27.770
Me!

00:06:27.120 --> 00:06:28.210
Me!

00:06:27.770 --> 00:06:28.600
Me!

00:06:38.280 --> 00:06:39.860
It worked!

00:06:41.560 --> 00:06:44.230
They fell for his words.

00:06:44.230 --> 00:06:46.230
They're just idiots.

00:06:57.960 --> 00:06:59.730
See that, Chou Soran?

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:01.360
I am your challenger.

00:07:01.820 --> 00:07:06.800
I'll burn the strength of your 
kitaigen style into these eyes.

00:07:06.800 --> 00:07:08.140
Have a seat.

00:07:09.160 --> 00:07:12.660
Meditate to calm your emotions.

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:14.070
We'll fight after.

00:07:16.530 --> 00:07:20.200
I want to fight you in your best condition.

00:07:29.050 --> 00:07:30.890
What a man you are.

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:36.230
I'm proud to be able to fight 
such a fantastic warrior.

00:07:39.830 --> 00:07:41.570
Now, then...

00:07:46.990 --> 00:07:50.430
Hey! Don't you have any pride as a warrior?

00:07:50.430 --> 00:07:52.840
Pride ain't worth jack!

00:07:53.110 --> 00:07:55.030
<b>Gave Soran his cape</b>

00:08:02.140 --> 00:08:04.140
Chou Soran wins!

00:08:05.120 --> 00:08:06.810
You're shameless!

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:15.210
Hey, Soran.

00:08:15.210 --> 00:08:17.810
I heard you used dirty tricks to win.

00:08:18.120 --> 00:08:19.450
I had to.

00:08:19.450 --> 00:08:21.050
I can't fight three guys at once.

00:08:22.690 --> 00:08:24.980
Well, a win's a win.

00:08:25.470 --> 00:08:29.140
So why did you ask us to come here, anyway?

00:08:29.950 --> 00:08:31.860
Is this a special match?

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:36.280
Yeah. Shokatsu Sei's 
match is about to start.

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:37.610
You don't want to miss this.

00:08:37.960 --> 00:08:41.750
Is Shokatsu Sei really that amazing?

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:44.430
He's the descendant of Shokatsu Koumei.

00:08:44.430 --> 00:08:46.660
Like it or not, he's bound 
to attract attention.

00:08:46.660 --> 00:08:50.460
I have a personal interest in him, too.

00:08:50.820 --> 00:08:54.410
The Shokatsu family is a mystery 
to the outsiders, as well.

00:08:54.770 --> 00:08:59.050
The kimontonkou style has been passed 
down in their family for generations.

00:08:59.050 --> 00:09:03.980
And Shokatsu Sei is apparently an expert 
who practices all of its techniques.

00:09:05.620 --> 00:09:09.520
Reigyoku-sama alone is 
already difficult enough.

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:12.940
Hey, they're not the only ones.

00:09:12.940 --> 00:09:16.180
This tournament is full of skilled fighters.

00:09:16.860 --> 00:09:19.330
First there's Shoushou, the shinki user.

00:09:18.490 --> 00:09:21.120
<b>Shoushou</b>

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:23.500
His style of kung fu involves expelling

00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:26.500
the ki inside him to rip his opponents' 
souls from their bodies.

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:29.630
It's said to have been developed 
by Eirin and Chinki,

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:32.340
otherwise known as the 
Kongourikishi in Buddhism.

00:09:33.060 --> 00:09:36.560
One solid hit, and you'll be 
turned into a powerless husk.

00:09:36.560 --> 00:09:38.700
You won't be able to fight.

00:09:39.730 --> 00:09:42.670
Watch out for Haku Shiishe, too.

00:09:40.800 --> 00:09:45.230
<b>Haku Shiishe</b>

00:09:43.470 --> 00:09:45.660
She's a natural-born outsider.

00:09:46.470 --> 00:09:50.000
She has the power to swallow 
her opponents' ki.

00:09:50.680 --> 00:09:54.340
If your ki is swallowed, you'll be 
sapped of your energy and collapse.

00:09:55.150 --> 00:09:59.380
Then there's Koketsu of Tougousou.

00:09:58.950 --> 00:10:02.990
<b>Koketsu</b>

00:10:00.990 --> 00:10:03.370
I heard he was bumming 
around instead of training,

00:10:03.950 --> 00:10:05.870
but there's something off about him.

00:10:07.450 --> 00:10:14.660
I wanted your ki, but apparently 
I'll lose if I kill you.

00:10:15.160 --> 00:10:18.150
I'm getting kind of worried 
about where this is all going...

00:10:19.090 --> 00:10:23.140
Shoushou

00:10:19.090 --> 00:10:23.140
Chou Reigyoku                                                  Haku Shiishe
Koketsu

00:10:19.090 --> 00:10:23.140
Shokatsu Sei

00:10:19.340 --> 00:10:20.340
Right.

00:10:20.340 --> 00:10:22.510
I'll bury Haku Shiishe here.

00:10:23.580 --> 00:10:27.600
Hou-nee, how many people are 
you planning on burying?

00:10:27.600 --> 00:10:28.640
All of them.

00:10:29.070 --> 00:10:33.040
The third Vermilion Bird 
match will now begin!

00:10:35.220 --> 00:10:36.130
Here they come.

00:10:46.690 --> 00:10:49.420
Looks like we're already on the same page.

00:10:49.820 --> 00:10:51.760
Shall we get started, then?

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:04.770
They're using their ultimate 
techniques already?

00:11:12.940 --> 00:11:15.560
<i>He activated something.</i>

00:11:16.180 --> 00:11:21.330
<i>I'll let the two of them fight in 
melee while I use ranged weapons.</i>

00:11:32.070 --> 00:11:34.270
Damn it. He keeps darting around.

00:11:35.310 --> 00:11:37.000
Hey, wind-user.

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:41.500
No matter what he does, he won't 
be able to pierce my kongou ouren.

00:11:41.790 --> 00:11:43.800
I'm going in. Back me up with your wind.

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:44.340
Got it.

00:11:47.090 --> 00:11:48.710
Reppuuren!

00:11:47.260 --> 00:11:48.310
<b>Reppuuren</b>

00:11:52.180 --> 00:11:53.430
Now!

00:11:58.560 --> 00:11:59.270
What?

00:12:01.030 --> 00:12:03.290
That looks like kimontonkou.

00:12:03.290 --> 00:12:06.400
Yeah. They've been sucked in 
completely by his technique.

00:12:10.450 --> 00:12:15.480
Impossible. How could he 
predict all of our attacks?

00:12:15.480 --> 00:12:17.740
Unlucky, aren't you?

00:12:17.740 --> 00:12:22.520
If you hadn't been there, his 
projectile wouldn't have hit you.

00:12:23.170 --> 00:12:26.090
Well? Do you want to keep fighting?

00:12:26.330 --> 00:12:29.220
I think you should get that looked at soon.

00:12:29.220 --> 00:12:32.340
You dodged my attack once, tanuki!

00:12:32.340 --> 00:12:34.390
But this time I won't miss!

00:12:39.520 --> 00:12:41.030
Reppuu Ranbei!

00:12:39.860 --> 00:12:41.030
<b>Reppuu Ranbei</b>

00:12:44.190 --> 00:12:46.230
You shouldn't have done that.

00:12:55.790 --> 00:12:57.590
Wh-What happened?

00:12:58.420 --> 00:13:00.640
He really blew him away.

00:13:01.210 --> 00:13:04.020
<i>Did he do that to himself?</i>

00:13:10.080 --> 00:13:11.350
What will you do?

00:13:17.250 --> 00:13:18.750
I surrender.

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:21.600
The match is over!

00:13:21.600 --> 00:13:23.940
Shokatsu Sei wins!

00:13:30.600 --> 00:13:32.080
Good luck!

00:13:30.980 --> 00:13:32.080
Sei-sama!

00:13:32.650 --> 00:13:33.750
He's gorgeous!

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:35.120
So hot!

00:13:37.010 --> 00:13:39.140
Good luck in your next match!

00:13:41.020 --> 00:13:41.970
Haku.

00:13:43.190 --> 00:13:45.910
What are you doing here?

00:13:45.910 --> 00:13:47.480
Did you finish your match?

00:13:48.990 --> 00:13:50.400
Sei-nii...

00:13:50.400 --> 00:13:53.360
I... I lost!

00:13:54.760 --> 00:13:56.050
You lost?

00:13:56.640 --> 00:13:57.770
That's not possible.

00:13:58.030 --> 00:14:00.100
Chou Reigyoku was in another group.

00:14:00.100 --> 00:14:02.330
No one else should be able to beat you.

00:14:02.330 --> 00:14:05.940
It was the Monster of Ryoutou, Kinmou.

00:14:05.940 --> 00:14:08.500
But you should be able to beat him.

00:14:09.630 --> 00:14:11.380
Well, I can't!

00:14:11.380 --> 00:14:14.650
His face is too scary.

00:14:16.410 --> 00:14:17.330
Hey.

00:14:17.570 --> 00:14:20.190
You're Shokatsu Sei's brother?

00:14:24.140 --> 00:14:29.150
I wanted to destroy that 
weakling, not this brat.

00:14:29.600 --> 00:14:30.740
But whatever.

00:14:31.210 --> 00:14:35.390
I'll amuse myself by beating 
this kid to a pulp instead.

00:14:35.390 --> 00:14:39.180
B-But I haven't done anything wrong!

00:14:39.180 --> 00:14:40.660
Shut up!

00:14:41.150 --> 00:14:44.550
I was so scared, my head went blank.

00:14:44.980 --> 00:14:48.620
I forgot all the kung fu I learned.

00:14:48.620 --> 00:14:51.220
I couldn't do anything against him.

00:14:51.680 --> 00:14:53.290
I don't know what to sa—

00:14:53.290 --> 00:14:57.640
Sei-nii, I'm a failure!

00:14:59.200 --> 00:15:00.500
Now, now.

00:15:01.360 --> 00:15:03.490
Don't cry, Haku.

00:15:03.490 --> 00:15:06.130
And don't wipe your nose on my clothes.

00:15:06.370 --> 00:15:07.850
Cheer up.

00:15:07.850 --> 00:15:11.250
I'll avenge you in my next match.

00:15:11.250 --> 00:15:14.720
How dare he bully my younger brother?

00:15:15.110 --> 00:15:18.680
But you won't get to fight him.

00:15:19.370 --> 00:15:21.450
When I came to...

00:15:25.470 --> 00:15:26.670
Huh?!

00:15:27.900 --> 00:15:29.870
I'm exhausted.

00:15:29.870 --> 00:15:33.110
Everyone's taking this fight too seriously.

00:15:33.860 --> 00:15:36.820
Ouya? I haven't heard that name before.

00:15:37.160 --> 00:15:39.410
Apparently he's from Butousan.

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:43.750
He's not ranked very high, 
and nobody knows who he is.

00:15:43.750 --> 00:15:47.780
But he's representing Butousan 
in the tournament anyway.

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:51.590
Panthers and tigers hide 
deep in the mountains.

00:15:51.590 --> 00:15:54.540
The kirin hides in the farms and fields.

00:15:56.480 --> 00:15:59.320
Ouya, huh? This is starting 
to get interesting.

00:16:02.760 --> 00:16:07.380
Hey, what kind of kung fu 
was Shokatsu Sei using?

00:16:07.380 --> 00:16:09.570
His reactions were really fast.

00:16:09.990 --> 00:16:15.740
He knows where and when 
his opponents will attack.

00:16:15.740 --> 00:16:18.150
What? That can't be possible.

00:16:18.150 --> 00:16:19.450
No, it is.

00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:21.660
Theoretically, anyway.

00:16:22.850 --> 00:16:28.830
I never trained in that technique, 
but I did dabble in kimontonkou a bit.

00:16:29.850 --> 00:16:33.670
Everything in this world has rules.

00:16:34.070 --> 00:16:36.620
These rules are known as tendou.

00:16:37.370 --> 00:16:42.360
Fighting techniques are about 
finding loopholes in the tendou.

00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:44.960
It's like hacking.

00:16:46.430 --> 00:16:52.570
Among them, kimontonkou seeks openings 
in tendou through space and time.

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:57.290
So he divined where his 
opponents would attack from?

00:16:57.560 --> 00:17:02.060
It's difficult to create the 
formula necessary to divine it,

00:17:02.060 --> 00:17:03.860
and even more difficult to solve.

00:17:04.120 --> 00:17:07.840
But Shokatsu Sei performed the 
calculations during a fight

00:17:07.840 --> 00:17:10.340
and predicted his opponents' attacks.

00:17:10.990 --> 00:17:16.330
Some kind of secret Shokatsu family 
technique must be behind it.

00:17:17.550 --> 00:17:19.810
I doubt I can beat him.

00:17:17.570 --> 00:17:20.970
Come on, let's have some fun.

00:17:19.810 --> 00:17:21.770
Don't let it get you down.

00:17:20.970 --> 00:17:23.550
I'll show you my kung fu tech—

00:17:21.770 --> 00:17:23.940
I'm sure you'll manage.

00:17:23.550 --> 00:17:24.990
You pervert!

00:17:29.450 --> 00:17:32.190
I'll bet on Dengaku Rinron-chan!

00:17:32.190 --> 00:17:33.390
You idiot!

00:17:33.390 --> 00:17:35.860
That little girl can't possibly win!

00:17:36.190 --> 00:17:37.630
What did you say?

00:17:37.630 --> 00:17:39.430
What? Got a problem?

00:17:39.430 --> 00:17:41.210
Hey, Zouryuu.

00:17:41.780 --> 00:17:43.790
Ah, if it isn't Chou Soran.

00:17:44.220 --> 00:17:46.350
What are you doing here?

00:17:47.260 --> 00:17:49.230
So you're Chou Soran.

00:17:49.230 --> 00:17:51.620
Feel like making a wager?

00:17:51.620 --> 00:17:52.640
A wager?

00:17:53.000 --> 00:17:57.730
Look at this. It's a website this fatty made
that contains information on outsiders.

00:17:57.730 --> 00:18:00.390
We're predicting the winner 
of the tournament based on it.

00:18:00.800 --> 00:18:02.980
These are the odds.

00:18:02.980 --> 00:18:05.490
And you can bet on yourself, of course.

00:18:04.180 --> 00:18:06.020
<b>Fuu Houhou

00:18:06.540 --> 00:18:08.890
Your odds are a hundred times higher?

00:18:08.890 --> 00:18:11.090
Just how little do people think of me?

00:18:11.090 --> 00:18:14.680
It's only natural after seeing 
how your first match went.

00:18:14.680 --> 00:18:18.790
Chou Reigyoku and Shokatsu Sei 
have the highest odds, huh?

00:18:20.450 --> 00:18:21.990
This guy has the highest odds, too.

00:18:21.990 --> 00:18:23.990
<b>Ja Seiryan</b>

00:18:22.780 --> 00:18:25.450
Ja Seiryan? Isn't that...

00:18:26.010 --> 00:18:29.330
He's the arms master of the Ja family.

00:18:29.330 --> 00:18:31.990
He's the dark horse of this tournament.

00:18:31.990 --> 00:18:32.710
Yeah?

00:18:32.710 --> 00:18:35.790
His match earlier was amazing.

00:18:41.500 --> 00:18:43.590
Hello, Mom?

00:18:44.280 --> 00:18:46.050
Yeah, I'm in the middle of a match.

00:18:46.470 --> 00:18:48.060
No.

00:18:48.480 --> 00:18:50.800
It's not a street fight or anything.

00:18:50.800 --> 00:18:52.770
It's a proper match.

00:18:53.410 --> 00:18:55.640
It's the Ten Elders' tournament.

00:18:55.640 --> 00:18:57.990
I wouldn't be here otherwise.

00:18:59.210 --> 00:19:01.640
I know what's going on with my brother.

00:19:01.640 --> 00:19:03.380
I told you...

00:19:03.380 --> 00:19:05.940
Hey, you! Do you even want to fight?

00:19:05.940 --> 00:19:08.750
I can't believe he got beat up by some girl.

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:10.540
He must be an idiot.

00:19:10.800 --> 00:19:12.500
How dare you mock me?!

00:19:13.580 --> 00:19:15.830
I know, Mom.

00:19:19.170 --> 00:19:22.130
You think that little stunt 
will work against me?

00:19:33.170 --> 00:19:34.610
Hey, over there.

00:19:34.610 --> 00:19:35.630
What?

00:19:35.630 --> 00:19:36.310
Look.

00:19:38.400 --> 00:19:40.150
That red-haired guy.

00:19:40.150 --> 00:19:43.170
An arms master, huh? 
He'll be a tough opponent.

00:19:43.170 --> 00:19:44.990
Why don't we take him out first?

00:19:44.990 --> 00:19:45.590
Agreed.

00:19:48.650 --> 00:19:50.000
We're here to help!

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:51.410
Let's get him together!

00:19:51.410 --> 00:19:52.010
Got it!

00:19:52.010 --> 00:19:55.040
You were babying him before.

00:19:55.040 --> 00:19:56.950
Aren't you being too hard on him now?

00:20:00.660 --> 00:20:03.950
Oh, wow. He's controlling three at once.

00:20:03.950 --> 00:20:07.980
I'd expect no less from the 
arms master of the Ja family.

00:20:07.980 --> 00:20:11.250
I came to find the girl 
who beat up my brother.

00:20:12.010 --> 00:20:13.160
This is nothing!

00:20:13.510 --> 00:20:14.350
Bring it on!

00:20:15.470 --> 00:20:17.260
We can handle three!

00:20:18.110 --> 00:20:19.590
You're wrong.

00:20:19.980 --> 00:20:23.040
It's not like I ran away because 
of the marriage meeting.

00:20:24.010 --> 00:20:24.890
No way!

00:20:24.890 --> 00:20:26.240
Six knives?

00:20:26.240 --> 00:20:28.040
It's true.

00:20:28.390 --> 00:20:32.010
And why does it have to be the 
daughter of the village mayor?

00:20:32.010 --> 00:20:38.010
I've been telling you forever that 
I prefer the pretty girls in the city.

00:20:38.010 --> 00:20:40.140
Seriously, what are you thinking?

00:20:49.110 --> 00:20:54.070
If I win this tournament, every girl in 
the country will want to get to know me.

00:20:54.070 --> 00:20:56.190
You don't need to worry 
about me getting married.

00:21:00.940 --> 00:21:02.920
Enough, Mom.

00:21:02.920 --> 00:21:05.530
Go see my brother in the hospital.

00:21:05.530 --> 00:21:06.530
Bye.

00:21:08.560 --> 00:21:11.340
I-I surrender...

00:21:12.160 --> 00:21:14.520
Ja Seiryan wins!

00:21:19.240 --> 00:21:22.300
Hurry up and find a wife, huh?

00:21:27.470 --> 00:21:28.990
<i>Fuu Houhou...</i>

00:21:30.440 --> 00:21:32.960
<i>Her hair is messy, and she's a slob.</i>

00:21:32.960 --> 00:21:34.760
<i>She's not my type.</i>

00:21:34.760 --> 00:21:37.510
<i>So I guess I'll avenge you, bro.</i>

00:21:40.230 --> 00:21:43.940
The sun came up, aiya, and it’s 
a clear and beautiful day, aiya

00:21:44.150 --> 00:21:47.910
The river cleanses the foot of 
the mountain as it flows through

00:21:48.160 --> 00:21:51.990
There are fish slowly swimming by, 
they’re fat and look delicious

00:21:52.200 --> 00:21:55.910
But I don’t want any if you 
don’t cook them with red peppers

00:21:56.080 --> 00:22:00.040
But I don’t want any if you 
don’t cook them with red peppers

00:22:01.500 --> 00:22:04.130
Cute, cute girl

00:22:05.550 --> 00:22:08.010
She has such a calm face

00:22:08.220 --> 00:22:11.930
But with her giant shovel, she 
goes from one hill to the next

00:22:12.180 --> 00:22:15.520
And fills them with holes

00:22:16.060 --> 00:22:19.770
I don’t know where she came from

00:22:20.020 --> 00:22:23.610
But if you make her mad, she’ll punch you

00:22:23.860 --> 00:22:27.740
She’s always in a daze, 
but she’s terrifying

00:22:27.950 --> 00:22:31.530
She’ll smack you without 
warning if you’re stupid

00:22:32.160 --> 00:22:35.660
Even in dark places where 
the moon doesn’t shine

00:22:35.950 --> 00:22:39.630
This dignified girl is never scared

00:22:39.880 --> 00:22:43.710
She works hard all night burying

00:22:43.960 --> 00:22:47.880
She buries others in order to survive

00:22:48.260 --> 00:22:52.140
The sun came up, aiya, and it’s 
a clear and beautiful day, aiya

00:22:52.350 --> 00:22:56.020
The river cleanses the foot of 
the mountain as it flows through

00:22:56.230 --> 00:22:59.900
There are fish slowly swimming by, 
they’re fat and look delicious

00:23:00.190 --> 00:23:03.980
But I don’t want any if you 
don’t cook them with red peppers

00:23:04.150 --> 00:23:06.740
But I don’t want any if you 
don’t have red peppers...

00:23:07.110 --> 00:23:09.070
I don’t, I don’t, I don’t!

00:23:09.910 --> 00:23:11.160
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:10.650 --> 00:23:12.330
Hello, Fuu Shinton here.

00:23:12.330 --> 00:23:16.380
Today I'd like to ask this 
mysterious pair a few questions.

00:23:16.380 --> 00:23:17.800
Let's start with Shokatsu Sei-san.

00:23:17.800 --> 00:23:19.130
What are your hobbies?

00:23:19.370 --> 00:23:20.880
Womanizing, I guess.

00:23:20.880 --> 00:23:22.750
You say that like it's nothing...

00:23:22.750 --> 00:23:24.340
And you, Ouya-san?

00:23:24.340 --> 00:23:27.300
Sleeping, sleeping, and going back to sleep.

00:23:27.300 --> 00:23:28.970
You can sleep your life away.

00:23:28.970 --> 00:23:31.540
Next time on <i>Hitorinoshita -
The Outcast</i>, "32 Men."

00:23:31.540 --> 00:23:34.190
By the way, what does "32 Men" refer to?

00:23:34.190 --> 00:23:36.050
The number of men I've buried.

00:23:36.050 --> 00:23:37.400
What? Seriously?

00:23:36.180 --> 00:23:39.940
<b>4: 32 Men</b>

00:23:37.400 --> 00:23:38.250
Seriously.
